1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
In the tool bar, you can find the tool group of the retopo, click on the scissors to read the list.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Now when creating a smart retopo, it can be absorbed into the inner line or the inner shape.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:32,000
The assist retopo point can now appear on the internal line of the retopo.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Just like the awl curve, the smart retopo can now be absorbed into the凸 curve.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
The retopo line created can now be absorbed into the inner line and the inner shape.

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
This is the result of the retopo.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Use the Y and U keys to quickly switch between the edit tool and the create tool.

8
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:12,500
Use the create tool to click on the Ctrl and Shift keys to add a row to separate the top face.

9
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:19,500
Use the create tool to create a top point on the top face that has already been created, and then cut the top face.

10
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:45,500
Use the edit tool to drag the mouse to select or cancel the selected point.

11
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:51,500
Thank you for watching and see you in the next video!

